sequenceDiagram
    participant R as React
    participant C as Component
    participant S as Suspense boundary
    participant P as Promise
    R->>C: render
    C->>P: use(promise)
    P-->>C: pending, suspends
    C-->>R: throws to nearest boundary
    R->>S: show fallback
    P-->>R: resolved
    R->>C: retry render
    C-->>R: UI with data
    R->>S: replace fallback with content
